WEBVTT

00:00:27.301 --> 00:00:29.511
[PEN SCRATCHING PAPER]

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.226
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:00:41.106 --> 00:00:44.067
I wish to enter my vault.

00:00:47.279 --> 00:00:49.531
Identification?

00:00:52.659 --> 00:00:55.204
I hardly think that'll be necessary.

00:00:57.706 --> 00:00:59.541
Madam Lestrange.

00:01:05.714 --> 00:01:07.674
I don't like to be kept waiting.

00:01:07.716 --> 00:01:09.259
GRIPHOOK:
They know.

00:01:09.301 --> 00:01:11.470
They know she's an imposter.

00:01:14.306 --> 00:01:16.099
They've been warned.

00:01:24.149 --> 00:01:25.734
Harry?

00:01:26.401 --> 00:01:28.445
What do we do, Harry?

00:01:33.909 --> 00:01:37.871
Madam Lestrange,
would you mind presenting your wand?

00:01:38.747 --> 00:01:40.165
And why should I do that?

00:01:40.207 --> 00:01:45.879
It's the bank's policy. I'm sure you
understand given the current climate.

00:01:45.921 --> 00:01:49.216
No. I most certainly do not understand.

00:01:49.258 --> 00:01:53.095
I'm afraid I must insist.

00:01:58.308 --> 00:02:00.269
HARRY [WHISPERS]:
Imperio.

00:02:00.644 --> 00:02:03.272
[SNIFFS THEN SIGHS]

00:02:05.774 --> 00:02:09.945
Very well, Madam Lestrange.
If you will follow me.

00:02:46.148 --> 00:02:47.274
HARRY:
What is that, Griphook?

00:02:48.066 --> 00:02:50.235
[SQUEAKING AND GRINDING]

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:54.072
Griphook.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:03.665
[ALL PANTING]

00:03:07.377 --> 00:03:08.962
[ALARM SCREECHING]

00:03:09.004 --> 00:03:11.173
[SCREAMING]

00:03:14.051 --> 00:03:15.552
HERMIONE:
Arresto momentum.

00:03:16.345 --> 00:03:18.138
[ALL GRUNT]

00:03:19.181 --> 00:03:20.682
HARRY:
Well done, Hermione.

00:03:20.724 --> 00:03:22.893
[ALARM CONTINUES SCREECHING
IN DISTANCE]

00:03:28.857 --> 00:03:30.734
Oh, no, you look like you again.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:35.322
The Thief's Downfall.
Washes away all enchantments.

00:03:35.364 --> 00:03:36.615
Can be deadly.

00:03:36.657 --> 00:03:38.408
You don't say.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:41.578
Just out of interest,
is there any other way out of here?

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.288
No.

00:03:44.206 --> 00:03:48.293
What the devil are all you
doing down here?

00:03:48.335 --> 00:03:49.670
Thieves!

00:03:49.711 --> 00:03:52.130
-When you gave up the keys, you--
-Imperio.

00:03:52.172 --> 00:03:55.050
[SNIFFS THEN SIGHS]

00:03:56.468 --> 00:03:59.054
[CREATURE ROARS NEARBY]

00:04:03.058 --> 00:04:05.268
That doesn't sound good.

00:04:07.062 --> 00:04:09.398
[GROWLING]

00:04:15.612 --> 00:04:17.155
RON:
Bloody hell.

00:04:17.197 --> 00:04:18.657
That's a Ukrainian Ironbelly.

00:04:18.699 --> 00:04:20.242
Here.

00:04:24.663 --> 00:04:26.081
[ROARING]

00:04:30.794 --> 00:04:34.339
It's been trained to expect pain
when it hears the noise.

00:04:34.381 --> 00:04:35.924
HERMIONE:
That's barbaric.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.539
Lumos.

00:05:11.668 --> 00:05:13.211
Blimey.

00:05:20.302 --> 00:05:22.471
Accio Horcrux.

00:05:24.014 --> 00:05:26.141
You're not trying that one again,
are you?

00:05:26.183 --> 00:05:28.977
GRIPHOOK:
That kind of magic won't work in here.

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:35.192
RON:
Is it in here, Harry?

00:05:36.026 --> 00:05:37.486
Can you feel anything?

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:49.748
[HISSING AND WHISPERING FAINTLY]

00:05:54.252 --> 00:05:55.837
[HERMIONE GASPS]

00:05:59.174 --> 00:06:01.802
That's it. Up there.

00:06:05.305 --> 00:06:08.725
They've added the Gemino curse.
Everything you touch will multiply.

00:06:08.767 --> 00:06:10.227
Give me the sword.

00:06:28.245 --> 00:06:29.913
Stop moving.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:53.770
Got it.

00:06:56.398 --> 00:06:58.149
We had a deal, Griphook.

00:06:58.191 --> 00:06:59.568
The cup for the sword.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:10.245
I said I'd get you in.
I didn't say anything about getting you out.

